{
 "name": "Life Story EP01 · multi-platform 4K pipeline",
 "nodes": [
  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## Life Story pipeline\nRuns per language (ko, en, jp): stock media → Typecast TTS → 4K HTML frames → MP4 (thumbnail first) → full-story + blog HTML → push to soulthread88 repos → MP4s to the videos Release.\n\nHost needs: python3, ffmpeg, Chrome, playwright, gh (authenticated), env TYPECAST_API_KEY, PEXELS_API_KEY, PIXABAY_API_KEY. Scripts: assets/life/ep01/pipeline.",
    "height": 220,
    "width": 520
   },
   "id": "989330cf-5272-4e3e-b0c5-af1b3684ff84",
   "name": "Read me",
